{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"おいシャン個握＠幕張"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありがとうございました!!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日は指原さんの握手会も同じ幕張であり、調印式も一緒に行いました"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これで、指原さんとは争うことなく"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"平和な関係を築けますね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/reika.sakurai/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/13/1378373/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"指原さんには、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「キャップが茶番慣れした」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"て言ってもらえたし♪(笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"指原さんにTシャツをいただいて"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"生駒ちゃんと着たし♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"楽しい握手会になりました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/reika.sakurai/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/13/1378373/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"会いに来てくれた皆さん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありがとうございました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/reika.sakurai/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/13/1378373/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/reika.sakurai/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/13/1378373/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あと、誕生日プレゼント・サプライズありがとう"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/reika.sakurai/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/13/1378373/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"!!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"素敵なものばかりで......"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大切にしますっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/reika.sakurai/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/13/1378373/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/reika.sakurai/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/13/1378373/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"写メなのですが、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"携帯の調子が悪い様で"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"上手く投稿出来ないので"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/reika.sakurai/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/13/1378373/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"また改めて、私服写メなどなど"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Blogにアップします；!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"楽しみにしてくれていた皆さん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ごめんなさい；"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"早くアップ出来る様に頑張ります"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/reika.sakurai/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/13/1378373/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/reika.sakurai/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/13/1378373/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とにかく、昨日は本当にありがとうございました♪"}],"source":"archive"}